 "title": "Road Bike by Jon",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c299\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">It gave me to custom fit the bike for me</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Immensely. It was a real challenge for me as I only have the use of 1 hand. The end product has a great sense of achievement.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c304\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c304\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Gluing the frame in the jig, quite tricky for me to get it lined up properly in the time limit of the epoxy.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Surprisingly the instructions, really easy to follow for me.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c309\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Really smooth, I\u2019m using quite heavy MTB rims but there\u2019s no rattles or creaks so that\u2019s a plus!</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c312\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Better quality group set and wheels for my next build (lugged gravel bike)</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/F5D3827A-1ACF-4ABA-83EC-0FCF3DEB2DA3_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830708\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/ACF49197-9D32-4499-BC83-E39DDE76BF98_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830731\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/FDF57B40-ADA3-4D3E-8149-4A6F56B9C28F_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830786\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/899A5A33-996F-4F39-92BC-4118B48A68D1_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830802\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/D9A5B4FD-9DC1-4F66-960F-A460ACEDA9B7_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830820\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/BBAD3EC6-4D57-4EAB-9FCF-A232914F45DE_-_Jon_Lovett.jpg?v=1660830845\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
